      "statement": "Durable dispatch uses `durability=\"async\"`, Protocol-v2 stream modes with resumable/subgraph streaming, and per-dispatch invocation ID and v3 streaming config; those settings preserve a checkpoint before each step and let dashboard clients replay runs they did not create.",
