      "statement": "A completion webhook is attached to dispatched runs only when both `RUN_COMPLETE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` is set and `COMPLETION_WEBHOOK_URL` is absolute and non-loopback; the receiving route rejects requests whose token fails verification.",
